                <pb facs="0253" n="137" xml:id="pg137"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/933.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-06-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 11, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Sir Edward Grey thinks it would be a mistake to move about the question of
                    Mongolia and Manchuria until he hears from the Russian and Japanese
                    Governments.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reid.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
